    "Passing checks are evidence for the tested configurations, not a proof of correctness.",
    "The seed reproduces the generated workload; the thread interleaving depends on the OS scheduler and is not reproducible.",
    "The linearizability checker verifies short bounded histories of add/remove/contains only; size() and snapshot() are not checked for linearizability.",
